{
 "source": "Official artwork as archived by PidgiWiki (pidgi.net), loaded at runtime from its image CDN (cdn.pidgi.net) as 400px-wide copies, not bundled; © Nintendo / Creatures / GAME FREAK. Checked on 2026-10-04 that each loads when requested from another site (scripts/check-trainer-sprites.mjs checks them too). Shown on the opponent card only; battles keep the Showdown trainer sprite.",
 "notes": [
  "Only special trainers and the Battle Legends have entries: Sun & Moon has no official 2D artwork for regular trainer classes (only in-game 3D 'VS' model renders, hosted by the Bulbagarden Archives, which blocks embedding on other sites).",
  "Not from the Pokémon Wiki (Fandom) or the Bulbagarden Archives: both block images from being shown on other sites.",
  "Cynthia and Wally appear in Sun & Moon in their Diamond and Pearl / Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire designs (matching their Showdown sprites), so that art is used.",
  "Trainers without usable art fall back to the enlarged Showdown sprite (see 'missing').",
  "Gym Leaders (custom special trainers, 2026-10-08): drawn artwork only, never renders of 3D models (so nothing from Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl), from each one's most recent main-series game other than Let's Go Pikachu / Eevee that has drawn art on PidgiWiki: HeartGold and SoulSilver (Kanto, Johto), Ultra Sun and Ultra Moon (Giovanni), Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire (Hoenn), Diamond and Pearl (Sinnoh), Black 2 and White 2 or Black and White (Unova). Thumbnails were generated through PidgiWiki's API (iiurlwidth=400).",
  "Elite Four and Champions (custom special trainers, 2026-10-10): the Gym Leaders' rule (drawn artwork only, from each one's most recent main-series game other than Let's Go Pikachu / Eevee): HeartGold and SoulSilver (Bruno, Lance, Will, Koga, Karen), Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire (Sidney, Phoebe, Drake, Steven, Wallace), Black and White (Alder), X and Y (Drasna, Diantha), Sun and Moon (Hala, Olivia, Acerola, Kukui). Thumbnails through PidgiWiki's API (iiurlwidth=400), each checked to load when requested from another site.",
  "Evil team leaders and admins (custom special trainers, 2026-10-11): the same rule, keyed like the sprites. Ruby and Sapphire art for the first versions of Archie and Maxie, Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire for their second versions and the Hoenn admins, HeartGold and SoulSilver (Rocket Executives), Diamond and Pearl or Platinum (Cyrus, Mars, Charon), Black 2 and White 2 (N), X and Y (Lysandre, Xerosic), Sun and Moon (Lusamine, Faba). Each checked to load when requested from another site."
 ],
